Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 15:47:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1177/1259] HERESY 1167: the day of 06.10 in all seven
 languages; day and night as the system by default, the button's icon larger;
 the coffee machine in About
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 06.10.2026:
· «SVG кнопки переключения режима день/ночь/система сделай побольше, и дефолтом поставь СИСТЕМА»: the icon 21 px (17);
  as the system by default, the system's day or night before the first paint. A theme of the kind the system shows now
  becomes that kind's theme; one of the other kind is a choice against the system, day or night as it is (the page test
  caught a dark theme picked under a light system gone after a reload). Day is kept as "light" now; the old default
  (day kept as nothing) is read as day once;
· the words of the day in ru, uk, be, el, es, it (117 keys each: the workspace in hand and its chooser, the models' idle
  unload, the take's way to the Librarian, pins from a room's column, the cheat-sheet's head and notes, the names of its
  60 new styles); the older genre names of the Styles tab stay English (rc2);
· «ссылка или кнопка на кофе… прямо на Stripe»: in About, with the website and the source: ☕ Buy me a Coffee Machine
  (his words of 01.10).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
